## Do You Need to Tip for a Pedicure?

How much should you tip a nail tech? In the US, 15 to 20 percent is the expected norm, treated the same way as tipping at a hair salon or sit-down restaurant. In the UK, tipping is optional and runs lower when it happens at all, typically 10 to 15 percent, and plenty of regular clients skip it entirely without any awkwardness.

